WEBVTT

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:23.899
Stars glitfer in the breaking dawn sky

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:28.695
After journeying from light years away

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:34.368
Man predicts our fate and destiny

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:37.454
But the ulfimafte destination

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:42.876
Is known only through blood, sweat, and fears

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.880
Stargazer! Turn! Turn! Earth!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.800
This life that was born here

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.555
Live sfrong and liberare LIGHT

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:58.559
A strong bond connects our hearts

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:01.562
You and | who baftle side by side

00:01:01.562 --> 00:01:04.231
The dancing flames of dawn

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:07.234
The beat that resounds fo efernity

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:10.070
The harmony of our feelings

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.781
Are flaring up... Ah

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:16.910
Awakening that fingling POWER

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:21.498
Shine on Destination!

00:01:40.851 --> 00:01:42.894
Gentoku... Ryuubi...

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:49.651
Mouyuvu, is this his next plan?

00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:50.944
Without a doubt.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:55.240
He possesses the ability to control beasts.

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:59.161
What happened, Kou-chan?

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:01.663
Why am | here?

00:02:01.663 --> 00:02:05.792
Gentoku, | don't have time to explain.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:08.295
We have to get out of here right now.

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:09.713
Tactician...

00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:16.553
Il hold the dogs here. Take Leader
with you and escape to the forest.

00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:21.350
Do we have to fight once more?

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:23.352
Then...

00:02:23.352 --> 00:02:24.728
| will do the fighting!

00:02:24.728 --> 00:02:27.147
You mustn'f!

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.983
You mustn't use your powers, Genfoku...

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:33.487
If you use them, everyone will suffer.

00:02:33.487 --> 00:02:38.158
But... | can't expose all of your lives to danger.

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.370
Il go with you...

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:45.165
If we meet Daiou Bokuroku in
the forest, Il do the talking.

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:47.668
I'll tell him to cancel the attack.

00:02:47.668 --> 00:02:50.587
Can we believe your words?

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:56.426
This is my chance to repay
you for sparing my life.

00:02:56.426 --> 00:03:00.389
You have my word as the leader
of Nanban High's fighters.

00:03:01.932 --> 00:03:03.600
Thank you very much!

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:05.394
Leader...

00:03:05.394 --> 00:03:07.729
Take care of her, Mouyuu.

00:03:10.399 --> 00:03:12.567
Kouchuu!

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:14.361
Take Leader with you, quickly!

00:03:19.908 --> 00:03:21.618
Mouyuu...

00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:26.206
| trust you... fighter to fighter...

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.553
W-Wait!

00:03:39.553 --> 00:03:42.472
My glasses... | lost them...

00:03:42.472 --> 00:03:44.599
Leader, about where?

00:03:44.599 --> 00:03:48.270
Um... further back, | think.

00:03:54.443 --> 00:03:56.737
Well done, Mouyuu.

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:03.452
With this, Il forget your two past failures...

00:04:03.452 --> 00:04:05.829
Is that a g-ghost?

00:04:05.829 --> 00:04:07.456
Is this Kentei?

00:04:07.456 --> 00:04:11.168
Now take Ryuubi's head.

00:04:11.168 --> 00:04:16.923
Then Nanban High will have conquered Kanto.

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:23.180
This is your best chance to leave
the shadows and enter the limelight.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.765
Mouyuu...

00:04:24.765 --> 00:04:27.267
