00:04:35.275 --> 00:04:37.360
How naive.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:43.992
1800 years ago, many formidable
warriors obeyed Gentoku Ryuubi's will.

00:04:43.992 --> 00:04:48.955
In the end, they all fell, leaving nothing at all.

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:53.627
Surely you haven't forgotten
who ultimately won?

00:04:53.627 --> 00:04:55.128
Is it possible?

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:59.132
You fighters have no need of a human heart...

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:02.803
You trust only in your strength...

00:05:02.803 --> 00:05:05.680
Now kill her!

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.641
Leader, stay back.

00:05:07.641 --> 00:05:14.314
Gentoku Ryuubi... | now want to
challenge you people face-to-face.

00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:16.650
That is why...

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.860
.| need you to remain alive.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:21.321
Huh? Mouyuu...

00:05:22.531 --> 00:05:25.700
| will return to Nanban High to fight another day.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.161
Do you understand? Back off!

00:05:29.371 --> 00:05:33.083
Fighters are foolish creatures, after all.

00:05:38.755 --> 00:05:40.715
- Who's there?
- If's you...

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:44.928
These are so finy and cute...

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:47.889
M-My glasses...

00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:51.726
Pardon me. Please return my glasses.

00:05:53.228 --> 00:05:56.106
| think Il try them on...

00:05:56.106 --> 00:05:57.274
Oops.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.901
They broke...

00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:01.570
How could you!

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.905
Nasty as ever.

00:06:03.905 --> 00:06:05.782
Who is this person?

00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:09.870
Nanban High third year, Daiou Bokuroku.

00:06:11.538 --> 00:06:17.794
Keep out of this, Mouyuu. Don't go
turning goody-goody on me now.

00:06:17.794 --> 00:06:22.382
You're a bad girl who went on
quite a lot of rampages yourself.

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:25.302
Yeah, | am a bad girl.

00:06:27.262 --> 00:06:29.222
But I'm a fighter!

00:07:11.181 --> 00:07:12.724
Are you okay?

00:07:14.184 --> 00:07:15.936
Bashoku...

00:07:15.936 --> 00:07:17.604
Sorry | took so long.

00:07:24.444 --> 00:07:25.820
Mouyuu...

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.489
Go on ahead!

00:07:27.489 --> 00:07:29.282
- But...
- Hurry!

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:30.659
Okay!

00:07:30.659 --> 00:07:33.119
You guys are all over the place...

00:07:33.119 --> 00:07:35.872
| don't have time for games.

00:07:35.872 --> 00:07:37.874
After | take down Seito's leader,

00:07:37.874 --> 00:07:43.380
the plan is to head off
to crush Nanyo's Sonsaku.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:48.385
If all goes well, Kentei will
make me the leader of Nanban.

00:07:48.385 --> 00:07:55.141
Nanban High doesn't need Kentei's
help to fight. Come to your senses.

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:58.687
You're the one who's not seeing straight.

00:07:58.687 --> 00:08:04.526
| don't care whose help or what means
| use. All that matters is winning!

00:08:21.001 --> 00:08:23.503
Gentoku, don't stop.

00:08:23.503 --> 00:08:27.549
Kou-chan.. Don't you feel anything, Kou-chan?

00:08:27.549 --> 00:08:32.178
Is it okay for a leader to do nothing but watch?

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:35.265
Is it okay just to watch?

00:08:38.685 --> 00:08:45.025
| understand how you feel...
But a leader must be a banner.

00:08:45.025 --> 00:08:50.530
A banner billowing in the wind, under which
fighters who bear a destiny gather.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:58.204
Kan'u, Chouhi, Chou'un, Kouchuu...
And Mouki Bachou, too0...

00:08:58.204 --> 00:09:01.958
You drew them here, across time.

00:09:01.958 --> 00:09:03.960
Even that fighter from Nanban...

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.629
It was your banner, Gentoku,

00:09:06.629 --> 00:09:10.091
