the meaning of why she fights.

00:09:11.259 --> 00:09:14.304
Well? Reconsidered?

00:09:15.889 --> 00:09:20.393
Bear it... and become stronger, Gentoku.

00:09:20.393 --> 00:09:26.316
Your power serves everyone...
and everyone is there for you!

00:09:38.161 --> 00:09:39.579
No bridge...

00:09:39.579 --> 00:09:43.166
