escape route beforehand.

00:09:43.166 --> 00:09:46.252
What're we going to do?
There's no way we can get down there.

00:09:46.252 --> 00:09:48.588
At the bottom is a river with rapids.

00:09:48.588 --> 00:09:51.674
Even if we made it down,
it'd be difficulf to cross.

00:09:51.674 --> 00:09:54.803
I'l look for a place we can cross.

00:10:01.976 --> 00:10:04.104
Mouyuu...

00:10:04.104 --> 00:10:06.439
This happened to you because of me...

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:08.358
Back away, Gentoku!

00:10:08.358 --> 00:10:09.609
But...

00:10:12.612 --> 00:10:17.283
