00:10:17.283 --> 00:10:19.202
Unforgivable...

00:10:19.202 --> 00:10:22.288
You look good when you're angry.

00:10:22.288 --> 00:10:25.166
But [l change that fo a teary face real soon.

00:10:25.166 --> 00:10:29.629
A crying face that's begging
and crying out for forgiveness!

00:10:32.841 --> 00:10:33.508
Coming at you!

00:10:33.508 --> 00:10:34.968
Huh?

00:10:39.889 --> 00:10:42.308
Stop it! Please stop if!

00:10:42.308 --> 00:10:43.643
Kouchuu!

00:10:48.523 --> 00:10:49.816
Fooll

00:10:49.816 --> 00:10:51.985
Stop! I'm begging you...

00:10:53.153 --> 00:10:55.530
Humph. Serves you right.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:57.115
Now then...

00:10:59.909 --> 00:11:01.161
Why?

00:11:02.579 --> 00:11:03.997
Why?

00:11:07.709 --> 00:11:09.085
Why?!

00:11:10.253 --> 00:11:13.006
Gentoku! You mustn't!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:46.623
