00:12:21.658 --> 00:12:25.954
Nanyo Academy's leader,
Hakufu Sonsaku, is here!

00:12:25.954 --> 00:12:28.289
| always wanted to say that!

00:12:28.289 --> 00:12:31.125
What? You're Son...

00:12:31.125 --> 00:12:32.252
Huh?

00:12:33.503 --> 00:12:38.007
It's been a while since I've gone up against a
guy with backbone. No holding back this fime.

00:12:38.007 --> 00:12:39.926
Who the hell are you?!

00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:50.770
I'm Nanyo Academy third year...

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:51.938
..Gakushu!

00:12:51.938 --> 00:12:54.357
He already passed out.

00:12:57.277 --> 00:12:58.778
Ryuu-chan.

00:12:58.778 --> 00:13:00.989
Ryuu-chan, can you hear me?

00:13:02.615 --> 00:13:05.785
It's me, Hakufu. Do you recognize me?

00:13:05.785 --> 00:13:09.455
That's... the Little Conqueror?

00:13:13.793 --> 00:13:18.339
You've come to? Thank goodness.
You had me frightened for a moment.

00:13:18.339 --> 00:13:21.009
When | arrived to ask you
about Koukin and the others,

00:13:21.009 --> 00:13:23.803
| suddenly found you in big trouble.

00:13:25.722 --> 00:13:30.810
Awaken. | will grant you the final power...

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:41.446
Sonsaku...

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:11.851
Son... saku...

00:14:11.851 --> 00:14:14.437
Ryuu-chan..

00:14:14.437 --> 00:14:17.190
Thank... goodness...

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.716
What happened to Ryuu-chan?

00:14:43.716 --> 00:14:46.135
A contradiction...

00:14:46.135 --> 00:14:53.101
The force of the dragon that
awakened to protect her friends

00:14:53.101 --> 00:14:58.898
and her pure heart that attempted to
restrain it clashed mightily inside her body.

00:14:58.898 --> 00:15:03.277
The energy from that intense conflict
likely formed a huge contradiction

00:15:03.277 --> 00:15:06.364
that transformed her appearance.

00:15:07.824 --> 00:15:12.370
To sacrifice one's life for what one believes...

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:16.457
The bond between fighters...

00:15:19.085 --> 00:15:22.797
That was something totally foreign to us...

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:29.262
Hmm... | don't really understand, but...

00:15:29.262 --> 00:15:31.931
How can we return Ryuu-chanback to normal?

00:15:31.931 --> 00:15:33.975
| don't know.

00:15:33.975 --> 00:15:35.351
But you have tol

00:15:35.351 --> 00:15:37.478
| don't know what | don't know.

00:15:37.478 --> 00:15:41.774
But if there is anyone who can save Gentoku...

00:15:41.774 --> 00:15:43.443
If there is?

00:15:43.443 --> 00:15:44.610
It'd be...

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:46.446
