you can do. Don't forget that.

00:16:29.697 --> 00:16:31.699
| won't,

00:16:31.699 --> 00:16:33.409
'l take you...

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:38.706
..1o Nanban High.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:55.056
