to build a school...

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:03.689
Still a long ways to go!

00:17:03.689 --> 00:17:05.358
Watch me, Master.

00:17:05.358 --> 00:17:10.613
'l rescue everyone and make
Nanban pay the price while I'm at it.

00:17:19.288 --> 00:17:21.916
