growing all over the place.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:08.421
This must lead to the school!

00:18:08.421 --> 00:18:09.922
What kind of plant is this?

00:18:09.922 --> 00:18:13.801
Ginormous bean sprouts! Or not...

00:18:20.933 --> 00:18:24.770
The flames are reacting fo
an immense fighting spirit...

00:18:25.771 --> 00:18:29.317
What in the world is going on?

00:18:39.535 --> 00:18:42.288
Looks like I'm the one he wants.

00:18:48.961 --> 00:18:51.797
Am | going to get to meet Kentei at last?

00:18:55.051 --> 00:18:56.677
That roar...

00:18:58.137 --> 00:19:00.306
What's going on up ahead?

00:19:02.016 --> 00:19:05.019
