00:20:13.087 --> 00:20:16.132
You're the one person
| don't want calling me that!

00:20:16.132 --> 00:20:20.469
Saku-dono, Kyosho Academy
readied this boat for us.

00:20:20.469 --> 00:20:21.554
Huh?

00:20:21.554 --> 00:20:23.139
You guys did this, Ton-chan?

00:20:23.139 --> 00:20:28.394
| wish | could go with you,
but this fime, [l leave it to you.

00:20:28.394 --> 00:20:30.104
Roger that!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:34.066
And this is from Moutoku.

00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:36.485
