00:20:37.653 --> 00:20:39.780
To me?

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:42.158
The Hyakuheki Dragon Sword.

00:20:42.158 --> 00:20:46.912
1800 years ago, Mousou took
three years to have this made...

00:20:46.912 --> 00:20:49.165
it's the most powerful
bejeweled blade of the ancients.

00:20:49.165 --> 00:20:50.958
Oh...

00:20:50.958 --> 00:20:55.421
If you're defeated,
Sonsaku, we'l go there next.

00:20:55.421 --> 00:20:59.008
Even if we're down to the last Kyosho fighter,

00:20:59.008 --> 00:21:02.011
