00:21:03.095 --> 00:21:05.806
Isn't that how you guys feel, as well?

00:21:05.806 --> 00:21:07.391
Ton-chan.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:14.815
Hakufu Sonsaku, as Nanyo's
leader, go there and crush them!

00:21:14.815 --> 00:21:18.194
That is the Basics!

00:21:18.194 --> 00:21:19.528
Right!

00:21:29.497 --> 00:21:34.460
Okay, we're off fo slay Kentet!

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:39.965
Chapter 7 "Silent Tears"
The End

00:21:45.888 --> 00:21:48.516
Within the storm that rages now

00:21:48.516 --> 00:21:52.144
I take hold of this destiny

00:21:52.144 --> 00:21:54.980
Even if I'm hurt or die My heart

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.983
I won't surrender, not for a second

00:21:57.983 --> 00:22:05.908
Oh, love which reaches towards the heavens

00:22:05.908 --> 00:22:09.411
